UID:J2xnkq13Fm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nWinner of this year’s Palme d
 ’Or at Cannes\, the latest from Iranian auteur Jafar Panahi — his firs
 t following his most recent prison sentence — follows a group of citizen
 s pondering revenge against a man they believe was their torturer. Jafar P
 anahi scheduled to attend November 20 6:45pm screening.\n\nhttps://www.sif
 f.net/cinema/in-theaters/it-was-just-an-accident\n\nEstimated start: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
